<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Gey van Pittius</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">fl. 1882–1885</span> · <a href="/centuries/19th-century">19th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Nicolaas <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/claudius">Claudius</a> Gey van Pittius was a <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/boers">Boer</a> administrator of the Land Goshen, a small republic proclaimed in 1882 at Rooigrond near <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mahikeng">Mafikeng</a> by Boer freebooters who had fought for a Tswana faction. Goshen merged with Stellaland in 1883, but <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/britain">Britain</a>'s <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/warren-expedition">Warren Expedition</a> ended both republics in 1885.</p></div>
